(2) 'Writes go to primary' as a standalone feature file: there is no such file in the contract, and I will not invent one. Note from the case above: 'write' ops emit no output line at all — only reads and errors/logs are rendered. Write routing to the writable node is observable only indirectly (e.g. via the sticky-pinning behavior in the by_default feature files). If that is what you actually mean, name it: feature3_1_by_default_sticky.

