Note the pinned semantics: by_default: true sits at the top level of the input, next to program. First bare read goes to the replica; the write sets a sticky primary pin; the following top-level read is pinned to the primary. If you also want the scope-interaction and primary-override variants of by_default mode, those are separate files — name them.

